	(text "Three terminals: CAN high, CAN low, ground.\nThere is no terminal for the car's 12 V (OBD2 pin 16).\nOBD2 pin 6 to CANH, pin 14 to CANL, pins 4 and 5 to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 314.96 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0495db2b-c8d3-5274-9c1d-73b17f48a213")
	)
	(text "CAN1: only if SJ1 is bridged with solder. It is open as built, because the car's bus\nhas its own termination and a third resistor would change it (CAN-6).\nCAN2: always fitted. It terminates the self-test bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 209.55 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "05b4e2bb-c84b-5b57-bf11-0ef3255ecabf")
	)
	(text "Termination"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "238e41df-727c-59ad-a858-8cbf5ef2d34e")
	)
	(text "SILENT high: both transmitters are off. SILENT low: they can transmit.\nLeft open, the transceiver's own pull-down would select 'can transmit', so R7 pulls SILENT high:\nafter a reset, a crash or with a blank chip, PC6 floats and the board is silent.\nLISTEN ties SILENT to 3.3 V, whatever the firmware does. OBD hands it to the firmware (TX_REQ_N, PC6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "28b555e6-d0d2-5892-b97e-fecc5a559a09")
	)
	(text "Bus pins withstand -58 to +58 V. Transmit timeout 0.3 to 5 ms.\nUnpowered, it disconnects from the bus (PWR-8)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 44.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a242b4f-fbd0-54cc-8514-ea190714fe6a")
	)
	(text "Switched by SILENT itself, not by firmware.\nLit only while the board is able to transmit.\nR11 keeps a fault in the transistor\nfrom pulling SILENT low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 105.41 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b484aa9-5b56-5412-8b3f-2b5ee571b424")
	)
	(text "LISTEN"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 78.994 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4493bb40-5a3a-593f-aeaf-06aa51824be6")
	)
	(text "Two 3-pin headers, one for each bus wire. A jumper cap joins the middle pin (CAN1) to one side:\npins 1-2 CAR: CAN1 to the car connector.  pins 2-3 TEST: CAN1 to CAN2.\nNo position joins CAN2 to the car connector. The headers sit apart, so a cap can't bridge between them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 180.34 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44b0787e-b431-58c5-91fd-ee4defe62b8f")
	)
	(text "C17: at U4 pin 5 (VIO)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 76.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
